{"id":17795,"name":"Genesee County","slug":"genesee-county","state":"Michigan","code":"MI","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-states/michigan-tax-deed-sales-property-deals-90-off/genesee-county/","lastUpdated":"2026-07-20T14:50:33","facts":{"taxSaleType":"Tax Deed Sale","typicalSaleDate":"Check Tax-Sale.info for updated sale dates","bidProcedure":"Premium Bid","deposit":"$1000 Credit Card Hold","redemptionPeriod":"None for tax deed sales","interestRate":"Not applicable to tax deed sales","extra":[{"label":"Sale Contact","value":"Genesee County Treasurer"},{"label":"Auction Site","value":"Tax-Sale.info"},{"label":"County Website","value":"Genesee County, Michigan"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"7jNB3hsXpd21vcXEWtfMxLKhRECI0mkPV1qZ8lmGa9v4BAUWQGARb5TzIOHH6qgfyubMolywC\"><iframe title=\"Properties at Jaw-Dropping Discounts - Genesee County - Michigan Tax Deed Investing\" width=\"1170\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/UduRu-0mx5A?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Properties-at-Jaw-Dropping-Discounts---Genesee-County---Michigan-Tax-Deed-Investing\">Properties at Jaw-Dropping Discounts in Genesee County, Michigan</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Invest in tax foreclosure sales in Genesee County, <a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-states/michigan-tax-deed-sales-property-deals-90-off/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Michigan</mark></a>, and get properties for 40 to 90% off. Here&#8217;s a comprehensive guide to help you navigate the process and seize these incredible opportunities.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Tax lien and tax deed investing can be a lucrative way to acquire property at significantly reduced prices. In Genesee County, Michigan, properties are sold through tax foreclosure sales, providing substantial savings and potentially high returns compared to traditional real estate investments.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Understanding-Tax-Lien-Certificates-vs.-Tax-Deeds\">Understanding Tax Lien Certificates vs. Tax Deeds</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Tax lien certificates and tax deeds are two different investment strategies:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Tax Lien Certificates</strong>: You purchase the lien on the property. The property owner must pay you back with interest. If they don&#8217;t, you can foreclose on the property.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Tax Deeds</strong>: You buy the property directly at the auction. There is no redemption period, and you take ownership immediately.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Steps-to-Start-Tax-Deed-Investing\">Steps to Start Tax Deed Investing</h2>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Research and Understand Local Laws</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Know the legal framework and key regulations in Genesee County.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Check <a href=\"https://www.geneseecountymi.gov/departments/treasurer/index.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Genesee County Treasurer&#8217;s Office</mark></a> for specific guidelines​​.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Visit the Local Treasurer&#8217;s Website</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>For tax deed information, visit the <a href=\"https://www.geneseecountymi.gov/departments/treasurer/useful_links_information/tax_sale_auctions.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Genesee County Treasurer&#8217;s tax sale auctions page</mark></a><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">​​</mark>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Check the Auction Site</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Auctions are held on <a href=\"https://www.tax-sale.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Tax-Sale.info</mark></a>, where you can browse properties and get auction details​​.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Read the Details About Tax Deeds</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Understand the sale schedule, parcel inquiry, and auction procedures.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Important dates and procedures are detailed on the county&#8217;s auction page​​.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Contact the County Office</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>For additional inquiries, reach out to the <a href=\"https://www.geneseecountymi.gov/departments/treasurer/index.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Genesee County Treasurer&#8217;s Office</mark></a>​​.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncen