 wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Important-Details\">Important Details</h4>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Pro-Tips\">Pro Tips</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Prepare Your Finances</strong>: Ensure you have the necessary funds available, including the deposit and potential property taxes.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Thoroughly Research Properties</strong>: Investigate the properties you&#8217;re interested in to avoid unpleasant surprises.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Follow Auction Procedures</strong>: Adhere to the auction&#8217;s bidding process to increase your chances of winning desirable properties.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"FAQs\">FAQs</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>What happens if I win a bid?</strong> Winners will be notified within an hour of the auction&#8217;s end and will receive instructions for payment and paperwork.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Can I inspect the property before bidding?</strong> It’s often recommend driving by the property, but you usually can&#8217;t conduct internal inspections before the sale.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Are there additional fees?</strong> Yes, there’s a $30 deed recording fee and a 10% buyer’s premium.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>For more details, visit the <a href=\"https://www.geneseecountymi.gov/departments/treasurer/index.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Genesee County Treasurer&#8217;s website</mark></a> and the <a href=\"https://www.tax-sale.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">auction site</mark></a>​​.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Useful-Links\">Useful Links</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.geneseecountymi.gov/departments/treasurer/useful_links_information/tax_sale_auctions.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Tax Deed Information</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.geneseecountymi.gov/departments/treasurer/index.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Treasurer</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.geneseecountymi.gov/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Official Website</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.tax-sale.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Auction Site</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Need-a-Hand?\">Need a Hand?</h4>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Book a call</mark></a> or access <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">free resources</mark></a> to jumpstart your tax lien or deed investing journey.</p>\n<p><em>Sign up or log in to view the full content.</em></p><div id=\"popup-overlay\"></div><div id=\"signup-popup\" style=\